  "widgetText:/service-page/pilates-private-class": {
   "url": "https://www.theartofbody.com/service-page/pilates-private-class",
   "text": "Pilates Private Class\n\npilates\n\n55 min\n55 min\n750.000 Rupiah Indonesia\nRp 750.000\nJalan Mertanadi\nRequest to book\nService Description\n\nPostural analysis, basic principles of pilates, One on One consultation. Or just straight out Core stability programs.. You choose..\n\nCancellation Policy\n\nTo cancel or re-schedule please notify us 24 hours before the class time, otherwise you are liable for the cost of the class.\nYou can reach us on the number below to confirm, cancel or re-schedule classes\n+6287839112400 Whatsapp\n\nContact Details\n\nStudio Pilates Bali | The Art Of Body, Jalan Mertanadi, Kerobokan Kelod, Badung Regency, Bali, Indonesia"
  },
