 "interact2.json": {
  "slides": [
   {
    "i": 0,
    "text": "TESTIMONIALS\n\n\"THE BEST, PILATES & BOWEN. I have tried it all — yoga all sorts & kinds, zumba, and more ( you name it I tried it). I was on the search to find something I like to practice more regularly. A friend recommended this studio, and i have been going since months and I love every single class. The teacher is just so concerned that you do the right movements on your own pace, the class sizes are small and personal. No matter what level you are, Faz makes sure you do it right, he is encouraging and motivating and so professional. You can see he is a teacher by passion.\" \n\n— Madlen, Vietnam\n\nTripAdvisor November 2017",
    "imgs": [
     "https://static.wixstatic.com/media/72d608_ae53137c9b414eaba9baeae609066e9e~mv2_d_6048_4032_s_4_2.jpg/v1/fill/w_1334,h_689,al_c,q_85,usm_0.66_1.00_0.01,enc_avif,quality_auto/72d608_ae53137c9b414eaba9baeae609066e9e~mv2_d_6048_4032_s_4_2.jpg"
    ]
   },
   {
    "i": 1,
    "text": "TESTIMONIALS\n\nAs a beginner to Pilates I wanted to strengthen my core, enhance my posture and improve my breathing techniques. Faz managed to improve all of these in a short space of time, I couldn't be more happier with the outcome. Not only that, I walked into Faz's studio having come out of hospital just 3 weeks prior for some major lower back problems. Within one session, Faz managed to unlock some of the issues I was having, and the next day I was pain free!! Thank you Faz, and look forward to seeing you again the next time I am back in Bali!\n\nAndrew pF220RI",
    "imgs": [
     "https://static.wixstatic.com/media/72d608_7fa37dc51ad8472f9d38c6d7f3e8a300~mv2_d_6000_3376_s_4_2.jpg/v1/fill/w_1334,h_689,al_c,q_85,usm_0.66_1.00_0.01,enc_avif,quality_auto/72d608_7fa37dc51ad8472f9d38c6d7f3e8a300~mv2_d_6000_3376_s_4_2.jpg"
    ]
   },
   {
    "i": 2,
    "text": "TESTIMONIALS\n\n\"Pilates at The Art of Body has helped me regain my core strength and has managed to completely eliminate my lower back pains. I can now move freely and do all the desired activities I want to do. I feel strong and rejuvenated with my new-found body! Thank you.\" \n\n— Ivana, Canada",
    "imgs": [
     "https://static.wixstatic.com/media/72d608_4ee14f1b440e4bb5bcf8ba1789439ff1~mv2.jpg/v1/fill/w_884,h_457,al_c,q_85,enc_avif,quality_auto/72d608_4ee14f1b440e4bb5bcf8ba1789439ff1~mv2.jpg"
    ]
   },
   {
    "i": 3,
    "text": "TESTIMONIALS\n\n\"Bowen therapy was suggested to me for relieving my menopausal mood swings and symptoms. After having tried many different modalities, I have not felt the bouts of hormonal imbalances after Bowen therapy.\"\n\n— Lynn, Australia",
    "imgs": [
     "https://static.wixstatic.com/media/6d1a1ebe80754b32b937794afc54aa59.jpg/v1/fill/w_1334,h_689,al_c,q_85,usm_0.66_1.00_0.01,enc_avif,quality_auto/6d1a1ebe80754b32b937794afc54aa59.jpg"
    ]
   },
   {
    "i": 4,
    "text": "TESTIMONIALS\n\n\"I went to Bali to relax and come back home to Sydney, feeling strong and revived. I contacted The Art of Body to add on a fitness holiday package while visiting the island. I was able to workout daily but still have a relaxing holiday. It was exactly what I needed!\"\n\n— Devon, Australia",
    "imgs": [
     "https://static.wixstatic.com/media/72d608_cc721588570a4514899a30ec6c5c0710~mv2.jpg/v1/fill/w_1319,h_681,al_c,q_85,enc_avif,quality_auto/72d608_cc721588570a4514899a30ec6c5c0710~mv2.jpg"
    ]
   }
  ],
